  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please add an action to launch the camera on the OSC endpoint used for camera interaction.\n\nCurrently, there is a Close action(/usercamera/Close), but no action to launch it.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202533-openbeta\n\nAdditionally, similar to how SteamVR's Input bindings have Camera and Stream_Camera modes, it would be better if OSC also allowed specifying which mode to launch in as a parameter.",
